{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42143","headline":"正初答锺郎中见招 · 徐铉","name":"正初答锺郎中见招","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高斋迟景雪初晴，风拂乔枝待早莺。\n南省郎官名籍籍，东邻妓女字英英。\n流年倏忽成陈事，春物依稀有旧情。\n新岁相思自过访，不烦虚左远相迎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42143.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42143","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}